INSERT INTO `wp_13_posts` VALUES (1,2,'2018-02-16 18:10:56','2018-02-16 18:10:56','An octogenarian, now deceased, Vasantha had been making kolams since childhood. A singer in her younger days, she spends most of her time today penning patterns and colouring them.\r\n\r\n[album catalogue fol=people/vasantha email=shasa@cselian.com][/album]','Vasantha','','publish','open','open','','vasantha','','','2018-02-16 18:27:38','2018-02-16 18:27:38','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/store/?p=1',0,'post','',1),(2,2,'2018-02-16 18:10:56','2018-02-16 18:10:56','This website is to showcase the work of artists and artisans connected to us and other paid products and services we are affiliates for.','About','','publish','closed','open','','about','','','2018-02-16 18:26:03','2018-02-16 18:26:03','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/store/?page_id=2',0,'page','',0),(17,1,'2018-08-25 09:06:47','2018-08-25 08:06:47','A happy soul, wanderer, doodler, comic lover...\r\n\r\nhttps://www.instagram.com/p/BhTwAhNAS-M/?utm_source=ig_share_sheet&igshid=59a6369byjjy\r\n\r\n[work config fol=people/aadhi][/work]','Aadhi','','publish','open','open','','aadhi','','','2018-08-25 09:06:47','2018-08-25 08:06:47','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/store/?p=17',0,'post','',0),(4,1,'2018-02-16 18:15:46','2018-02-16 18:15:46','','Vasantha','','inherit','closed','closed','','2-autosave-v1','','','2018-02-16 18:15:46','2018-02-16 18:15:46','',2,'http://yieldmore.org/store/2018/02/16/2-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(5,1,'2018-02-16 18:19:25','2018-02-16 18:19:25','An octogenarian, now deceased, Vasantha had been making kolams since childhood. A singer in her younger days, she spends most of her time today penning patterns and colouring them.\n\n[album fol=people/vasantha email=shasa@csela','Vasantha','','inherit','closed','closed','','1-autosave-v1','','','2018-02-16 18:19:25','2018-02-16 18:19:25','',1,'http://yieldmore.org/store/2018/02/16/1-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(6,1,'2018-02-16 18:21:49','2018-02-16 18:21:49','I recently started making jewellery with my friend Uma as a way to keep busy and discover an inner fount of expression.\r\n\r\n[album catalogue fol=people/jyothi email=jyothiramaunni@yahoo.co.in][/album]','Jyothi','','publish','open','open','','jyothi','','','2018-02-16 18:27:13','2018-02-16 18:27:13','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/store/?p=6',0,'post','',0),(14,1,'2018-07-29 11:08:49','2018-07-29 10:08:49','Some very exciting products homemade and brought to you by Srividya. To contact her, please get in touch here: <a href=\"mailto:+91-8838344322\">+91-8838344322</a> or send a mail to <a href=\"mailunwindme.in@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\">unwindme.in@gmail.com</a>.\n\n<iframe src=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vTQW0Qx5JHliUkBILvgCajHv2gxngE7JP2hdh3zuzCCZRht_4rchMhg6PZ4Y5ZUNfmpcPW4IP8RRcP0/embed?start=true&loop=true&delayms=10000\" frameborder=\"0\" width=\"960\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" mozallowfullscreen=\"true\" webkitallowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe>\n\n<!--more-->\n\nhttps://www.instagram.com/p/BkrpkggHw4z/\n\nhttps://www.instagram.com/p/Bkro1hcnpBw/\n\nhttps://www.instagram.com/p/BkrmeEXHqVg/\n\n[work config fol=unwind-me][/work]','Unwind Me','','inherit','closed','closed','','13-autosave-v1','','','2018-07-29 11:08:49','2018-07-29 10:08:49','',13,'http://yieldmore.org/store/13-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(13,1,'2018-07-07 14:39:46','2018-07-07 13:39:46','Some very exciting products homemade and brought to you by Srividya. To contact her, please get in touch here: <a href=\"tel:+91-8838344322\">+91-8838344322</a> or send a mail to <a href=\"mailto:unwindme.in@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\">unwindme.in@gmail.com</a>.\r\n\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-JU6-_0O7OU&list=PLQeUqoAHHiRVYLr1stWkkxDURRDzn7vaU\r\n\r\n<iframe src=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vTQW0Qx5JHliUkBILvgCajHv2gxngE7JP2hdh3zuzCCZRht_4rchMhg6PZ4Y5ZUNfmpcPW4IP8RRcP0/embed?start=true&loop=true&delayms=10000\" frameborder=\"0\" width=\"960\" height=\"400\" al