INSERT INTO `wp_18_posts` VALUES (1,2,'2019-01-28 02:08:59','2019-01-28 02:08:59','[info]\r\nsource: http://jeevanvidya.info/register/\r\nlink: http://yieldmore.org/media/books/jeevan-vidya/jv-parichay-shivirs-2018/\r\n[/info]\r\n\r\nContact: Balmukund: 7089313341','Madhyasth Darshan - Introduction Programmes','','publish','open','open','','introduction-programmes','','','2019-01-28 09:08:52','2019-01-28 09:08:52','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/jeevanvidya/?p=1',0,'post','',1),(2,2,'2019-01-28 02:08:59','2019-01-28 02:08:59','[info]\r\nsource: http://madhyasth-darshan.info/introduction/brief/\r\nlink: http://yieldmore.org/media/books/jeevan-vidya/\r\n[/info]\r\n\r\nMadhyasth Darshan or â€˜Coexistential Thoughtâ€™ is the name for a set of propositions about reality.  It has come about via original existential exploratory-research by (late) Shri A Nagraj of Amarkantak, India (originally from Hassan, Karnataka). It is a new discovery of the fundamental nature of the Universe, Human Being, Consciousness & Human purpose. It discusses the nature of matter, conscious, space & evolution and thus demystifies the human being and existence.\r\n\r\nThis comprehensive knowledge system (darsana) examines all dimensions of human life: the existential-experiential, intellectual, logical-rational, emotional-behavioral & occupational. It has solutions for the myriad  problems all of us face, the world faces.\r\n\r\nThis is an â€˜existence based human focused contemplationâ€™. It is being presented here as an â€˜Alternativeâ€™ to Materialism/Science and Theism/Spiritualism for evaluation and study by mankind. The aims, content, process and outcomes (lifestyle) proposed in Madhyasth Darshan are different from those in Materialism & Spiritualism.\r\n\r\nThis is not based on any caste, religion or sect, but on natural laws, on reality â€“ in a way that every human can understand them in his/her own right and live with this understanding.\r\n\r\nThis understanding comes in living: Madhyasth Darshan enables freedom from prevailing criminal mentality, freedom from ignorance (delusion) and freedom from communal mentality between peoples via consciousness development .\r\n\r\nThis philosophy has sound proposals to resolve our current issues such as:\r\n\r\nPersonal strife and meaninglessness\r\nInterpersonal issues with people â€“ in the family & around\r\nSocietal conflict â€“ like war & exploitation\r\nEcological problems â€“ pollution & resource depletion\r\nThis understanding results in living with simplicity, generosity, kindness & benevolence. We can understand ourselves as humans and fulfill our relationships in family, society and nature. \r\n\r\nThis is happiness. \r\n\r\nThis is to inform you that based on this understanding of developed human consciousness, the following universal tenets have been understood:\r\n\r\nKnowledge, Wisdom & Science; Reality, Actuality & Truth;\r\nUniversal humane Justice, Religion & Education;\r\nBasic Structure of Human Society, and\r\nWorld Constitution & Organization of Nation States.\r\nWe can now live purposeful and meaningful lives. \r\n\r\nThe expectation of â€œknowledgeâ€ from India has now been completed\r\n\r\nà¤­à¤¾à¤°à¤¤ à¤¸à¥‡ à¤œà¥à¤žà¤¾à¤¨ à¤•à¥€ à¤…à¤ªà¥‡à¤•à¥à¤·à¤¾ à¤ªà¥‚à¤°à¥€ à¤¹à¥‹ à¤šà¥à¤•à¥€ à¤¹à¥ˆ |\r\n\r\nTerms:\r\n\r\nMadhyasth â€“ means Mediating, the stabilizing aspect in Existence.\r\nDarshan â€“ or darsana is a direct insight into reality and its exposition\r\nSaha-Astitva-vad: Coexistential Thought or Coexistentialism, based on the darsana\r\nJeevan â€“ name for the conscious aspect, unit\r\nJeevan Vidya â€“ program for public dissemination','About','','publish','closed','open','','about','','','2019-01-28 09:02:04','2019-01-28 09:02:04','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/jeevanvidya/?page_id=2',0,'page','',0),(3,1,'2019-01-28 02:09:09','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','Auto Draft','','auto-draft','open','open','','','','','2019-01-28 02:09:09','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/jeevanvidya/?p=3',0,'post','',0),(7,38,'2019-01-28 04:09:48','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','Auto Draft','','auto-draft','open','open','','','','','2019-01-28 04:09:48','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/jeevanvidya/?p=7',0,'post','',0),(8,1,'2019-01-28 08:58:18','2019-01-28 08:58:18','[info]\nsource: http://madhyasth-darshan.info/introduction/what-it-implies-for-us/\n[/info]\n\n','About','','inherit','closed','closed','','2-autosave-v1','','','2019-01-28 08:58:18','2019-01-28 08:58:18','',2,'http://yieldmore.org/jeevanvidya/2019/01/28/2-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(9,1,'2019-01-28 09:08:09','2019-01-28 09:08:09','[info]\nsource: http://jeevanvidya.info/register/\nlink: http://yieldmore.org/media/books/jeevan-vidya/jv-parichay-shivirs-2018/\n[/info]\n\nContact:\nBalmukund: ','Madhyasth Darshan - Introduction Programmes','','inherit','closed','closed','','1-autosave-v1','','','2019-01-28 09:08:09','2019-01-28 09:08:09','',1,'http://yieldmore.org/jeevanvidya/2019/01/28/1-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0);
