INSERT INTO `wp_20_posts` VALUES (1,41,'2019-03-11 09:59:20','2019-03-11 09:59:20','Coming at you through space and time - this is no time to reel away from our mission - to SPREAD <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kyI1OImD7ow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">JOY TO THE WORLD</a>!','Coming At You','','publish','open','open','','coming-at-you','','','2019-03-11 10:15:45','2019-03-11 10:15:45','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/joy-mission/?p=1',0,'post','',0),(2,41,'2019-03-11 09:59:20','2019-03-11 09:59:20','The Joy Mission was founded by Yaseva and has its headquarters at:\r\n\r\nJoypreneurs\r\nNo. 5 A, Central Avenue, Kodambakkam, Taylor Estate, Kodambakkam, Chennai, Tamil Nadu 600024\r\n044 4232 2092\r\n<a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/t2gv5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://maps.app.goo.gl/t2gv5</a>','About Joy Mission','','publish','closed','open','','about','','','2019-03-11 10:15:47','2019-03-11 10:15:47','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/joy-mission/?page_id=2',0,'page','',0),(4,41,'2019-03-11 10:09:36','2019-03-11 10:09:36','Coming at you through space and time - this is no time to reel away from our mission - to','Coming At You','','inherit','closed','closed','','1-autosave-v1','','','2019-03-11 10:09:36','2019-03-11 10:09:36','',1,'http://yieldmore.org/joy-mission/1-autosave-v1/uncategorised/',0,'revision','',0),(5,41,'2019-03-11 10:14:18','2019-03-11 10:14:18','The Joy Mission was founded by Yaseva and has its headquarters at:\n\nJoypreneurs\nNo. 5 A, Central Avenue, Kodambakkam, Taylor Estate, Kodambakkam, Chennai, Tamil Nadu 600024\n044 4232 2092\n<a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/t2gv5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://maps.app.goo.gl/t2gv5</a>','About Joy Mission','','inherit','closed','closed','','2-autosave-v1','','','2019-03-11 10:14:18','2019-03-11 10:14:18','',2,'http://yieldmore.org/joy-mission/2-autosave-v1/uncategorised/',0,'revision','',0),(7,41,'2019-03-11 10:57:53','2019-03-11 10:57:53','A core part of our Joypreneur / Joystreet program is care for the elderly. In this, we have Imran and Saify\'s flagship \"Consciously Growing Older\" program which focuses on the needs of 50+ year old people. Their relations with adult sons and daughters is strengthened in the 2 day workshop where estranged children / spouses are welcome on the 2nd day, after a small transformation is manifest.\r\n\r\nWe also support the Feature Film \"<a href=\"https://gdmvindia.com/burden-of-love/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Burden of Love</a>\" by Filmmaker Muner Ahamed','Caring for the Elderly','','publish','open','open','','caring-for-the-elderly','','','2019-03-11 10:57:53','2019-03-11 10:57:53','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/joy-mission/?p=7',0,'post','',0);
