l we work on / import the contents, you can see the glossary in <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1CWFk1VRaweAKjlvSm0KRGqvlQPKAA3yZnOE1-SXT0tg/edit?pli=1#gid=0\" target=\"_blank\">this shared google spreadsheet</a>\n\n<a name=\"siddha\" />\n<h3>Siddha Powders</h3>\nFor Stress and Depression, here is our mix:\n<ol>\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.healthline.com/nutrition/12-proven-ashwagandha-benefits\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Ashwagandha</a> - Withania somnifera, Indian ginseng and winter cherry - it can lower blood sugar levels, reduce cortisol, boost brain function and help fight symptoms of anxiety and depression.</li>\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.webmd.com/vitamins/ai/ingredientmono-1125/tree-turmeric\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Tree Turmeric</a> - People take tree turmeric for heart failure, liver disease, malaria, an eye infection called trachoma, skin diseases, heavy menstrual periods, swelling of the stomach and intestines (gastroenteritis), diarrhea, and yellowed skin (jaundice).</li>\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.naturalfoodseries.com/11-health-benefits-amla/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Gooseberry</a> - Amla or Nellikkai - health benefits includes supporting eye health, keeping the body hydrated, supporting a healthy appetite, slowing down aging process, preventing infection, managing digestion, supporting healthy heart, reducing PMS symptoms, managing diabetes, improving hair properties and aiding metabolism.</li>\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.bimbima.com/herbs/vishnukranthi-evolvulus-alsinoides-information-benefits-and-uses/65/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Vishnukranthi</a> - Evolvulus alsinoides -  is used to treat mental disorders, nervous weakness, insomnia, fever, cough, asthma, and skin diseases. It helps as a general tonic, and gives good health.</li>\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.naturalfoodseries.com/10-benefits-moringa-seeds/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Drumstick (Moringa) Seed</a> - its benefits may include reducing blood sugar level, maintaining cholesterol and blood pressure, improving skin health, purifying water, improving sleep, improving digestion, preventing infection and illness, increasing energy level, improving eye vision, and detoxifying the body.</li>\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.webmd.com/vitamins/ai/ingredientmono-761/bacopa\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Brahmi</a> (Bacopa) - is commonly used for Alzheimer\'s disease, improving memory, anxiety, and attention deficit-hyperactivity disorder (ADHD) among many other uses</li>\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.healthline.com/nutrition/cocoa-powder-nutrition-benefits\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Bitter Cocoa Powder</a> - reduced inflammation, better blood flow, lower blood pressure and improved cholesterol and blood sugar levels</li>\n</ol>','Herbs and Spices','','inherit','closed','closed','','5-autosave-v1','','','2019-03-28 16:04:51','2019-03-28 10:34:51','',5,'http://yieldmore.org/heal/glossary/5-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(84,37,'2019-01-22 23:17:30','2019-01-22 17:47:30','Hi there, I\'m Vibha Sethi.\r\n\r\nAm into rejuvenation of the body and mind through detoxifying processes and inner awakening practices which include\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Chanting (<a href=\"https://www.sgi.org/about-us/nam-myoho-renge-kyo.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Nam Myoho Renge Kyo</a>)</li>\r\n 	<li>Use of Ionized, Molecule Structured, Alkalined water (<a href=\"https://www.enagic.com/?c=water\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kangen Water</a>)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nEducation of Youth and Adults alike in all facets of wellness is undertaken for both individuals and groups.\r\n\r\nYou may contact me at +91.9445267038','Vibha\'s Corner','','publish','closed','open','','vibhas-corner','','','2019-01-22 23:17:30','2019-01-22 17:47:30','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/heal/?p=84',0,'post','',0),(87,1,'2019-03-15 16:19:15','2019-03-15 10:49:15','[info]\r\ntel: +91.9940680091\r\nemail: kneela75@gmail.com\r\n[/info]\r\n\r\nStay tuned for insightful articles from the new healer (on our network) - Neela\r\n\r\nRegistration for her upcoming workshop on \"Energy Healing\" on the 24th March 2019 can be seen <a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/events/\">here</a>.','Intuitions Whispers by Neela','','publish','closed','open','','intuitions-whispers','','','2019-03-15 16:19:15','2019-03-15 10:49:15','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/heal/?p=87',0,'post','',0),(89,1,'2019-07-17 22:52:51','2019-07-17 17:22:51','<p>Cancer thrives in acidic bodies. We have identified 5 promising solutions to cancer.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The resources at <a href=\"http://chrisbeatcancer.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Chris Beat Cancer</a></li>\n<li>Forever Living Products and <a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/heal/systems/kangen-water/\">Kangen Water</a> treatment (Vibha @ 9445267038)</li>\n<li>Ozone Treatment (contact Ozone Generator Manufacturer Shyam @ 9176012476)</li>\n<li>Medical Marijuana</li>\n<li>Zero Medicine Wisdom (Saify @ 9884087860)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Â </p>\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>[work config fol=combat/cancer][/work]</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Cancer','','inherit','closed','closed','','39-autosave-v1','','','2019-07-17 22:52:51','2019-07-17 17:22:51','',39,'http://yieldmore.org/heal/glossary/39-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(92,1,'2019-08-10 21:13:51','2019-08-10 15:43:51','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A goon or gunda is able to break into a woman\'s house, rape her and then she has to suspend her life in America to come here over 5 years and see him thrown in jail...</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Not much later she hears he\'s been let out on bail!!!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Fellow Indians, I ask you - what is wrong and how can we fix it? I would like for the following to happen.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Someone write a letter to her apologizing for the scumbag\'s behaviour.</li><li>Gundas like her family are taken to task for threatening people.</li><li>An NGO take up the cause of rape and offer counselling to those who do it. New points of view such as https://yieldmore.org/incubate/spontaneous-love/miscreants/ are brought out.</li><li>Generally criminals are treated with a little dignity and wholeheartedly offered a chance at redemption and reform.</li><li></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:core-embed/wordpress {\"url\":\"https://www.shethepeople.tv/news/viral-video-angry-us-woman-slams-india-rapist-bail\",\"type\":\"wp-embed\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"shethepeople-tv\",\"className\":\"\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed-wordpress wp-block-embed is-type-wp-embed is-provider-shethepeople-tv\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.shethepeople.tv/news/viral-video-angry-us-woman-slams-india-rapist-bail\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:core-embed/wordpress -->','The misuse of Power and the spread of Corruption','','publish','closed','open','','the-misuse-of-power-and-the-spread-of-corruption','','','2019-08-10 21:15:11','2019-08-10 15:45:11','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/heal/?p=92',0,'post','',0),(95,1,'2019-08-11 15:02:40','2019-08-11 09:32:40','<!-- wp:html -->\n[info]\nsource: https://gitanjaliforeverliving.wordpress.com/2017/07/31/back-pain-and-forever-living-products/\nsource: https://in.pinterest.com/pin/540924605221684053/\nlink: https://www.scribd.com/doc/59646105/Spinal-Emotional-Associations-Louise-Hay\nsource: https://www.medindia.net/news/interviews/dr-krishna-raman-on-holistic-health-and-fitness-50059-1.htm\nsource: https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4278133/\nsource: http://mediyoga.co.in/meetdoctor.html\nlink: https://www.scribd.com/doc/59646105/Spinal-Emotional-Associations-Louise-Hay\nsource: https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4604560/\nlink: http://www.brainsync.com/blog/alpha-waves-can-help-chronic-pain/\nlink: https://www.brainsync.com/brainlab/research-findings.html\n[/info]\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This used to plague me years ago. I will be back to expand on this later :)</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Back Pain','','publish','closed','open','','back-pain','','','2019-08-11 15:02:40','2019-08-11 09:32:40','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/heal/?p=95',0,'post','',0),(97,1,'2019-09-01 22:12:13','2019-09-01 16:42:13','<!-- wp:core-embed/facebook {\"url\":\"https://www.facebook.com/jewishcarevictoria/videos/2038879093076743/?app=fbl\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"facebook\",\"className\":\"\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed-facebook wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-facebook\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.facebook.com/jewishcarevictoria/videos/2038879093076743/?app=fbl\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:core-embed/facebook -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If forgiveness is the key to your own happiness, then hate must be like a cancer that eats you!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Why hate when you can forgive','','inherit','closed','closed','','96-autosave-v1','','','2019-09-01 22:12:13','2019-09-01 16:42:13','',96,'http://yieldmore.org/heal/glossary/96-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(98,1,'2019-09-08 14:59:01','2019-09-08 09:29:01','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In this article, outlined in Jan 2016, we discuss various ideas to overcome depression and inertia.  The chief goal is to be productive, have energy and to prevent from vegetating. We also suggest you schedule distraction-less work state (flow state) and adhere to it </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>keep i diary, write only when you feel like</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>make 2 halves of a page and list positive feelings and triggers on one side and negative on the other. when something negative finds its way into your thoughts, as soon as possible shift your focus to something positive</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>omit the negative as far as possible</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>go back to old sources of comfort + inspiration - preferably songs and movies, not books because books demand the right frame of mind, the others dont</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>dont think of love songs unless you are in the correct emotional state</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>relive your childhood - play with clay / watch cartoons / read childrens stories etc</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>music is the biggest part, find stuff that stimulates your vital being (giving you energy) but also the intellect, your ideals and your spirit.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>try and focus on all the people you love and try and send good thoughts and feelings their way. don\'t interact directly with them, but keep them in your thoughts. in time you will develop the right attitudes to help them - just a theory I\'ve had before.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Neuro linguistic and phonetic programming... try <a href=\"http://meditate.me\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" aria-label=\" (opens in a new tab)\">one of these</a> - its based on brain science and affirmations. guaranteed to work.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>learn heal share experience emote express love and <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ggB1BzlIJ-ZSps8FIaK26_dbA5bfFjKrNK3S2BlA8es\">yieldmore</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>if you had read curious lives (now its lost) you would have met <a href=\"http://www.amazon.com/Writer-Ferrets-Chasing-Ferret-Chronicles/dp/0743227549\">Budgeron</a> whose a writer whose overcome a major block. the <a href=\"https://books.google.co.in/books?id=GoseLxfaqpQC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" aria-label=\" (opens in a new tab)\">3 rules</a> - have fun, dont think, dont careso try and write something small a week (you can invent fictitious lovers like I have <a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/speak/ethos/shasas-speeches/?node=4-partners\">Tracey</a> and start writing to them).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Find new music and listen only to the ones that inspire.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Do all the activities that put you in touch with yourself, dont beat yourself up for not doing anything, and hug yourself atleast 10 times a day.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Make your own <a href=\"/heal/practices/affirmations/\">affirmations</a> like <a href=\"/speak/imran/affirm/\">mine</a> or follow someone like <a href=\"/movements/sharing-love/heal-with-love/\">Louise Hay</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Get Rhythm','','publish','closed','open','','get-rhythm','','','2019-09-08 14:59:01','2019-09-08 09:29:01','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/heal/?p=98',0,'post','',0);
