INSERT INTO `wp_7_posts` VALUES (1,1,'2015-11-23 02:06:28','2015-11-22 20:36:28','Electronics is the biggest market in the world. Our team of educating people in this field is lead by Shyam - rajanssundar@gmail.com / 9840748395.','Electronics','','publish','open','open','','electronics','','','2017-12-25 16:00:46','2017-12-25 10:30:46','',0,'http://accredit.yieldmore.org/?p=1',0,'post','',0),(2,1,'2015-11-23 02:06:28','2015-11-23 02:06:28','This is the venture of YieldMore.org to impart career related skills to students and adults.\r\n<h2>Mentoring Network</h2>\r\nFor PWM (training) we have a free directory (<a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/peaceworks/people\">http://yieldmore.org/peaceworks/people</a>). If the trainer chooses to become an affiliate, we charge a fee from them of 20% and they will be eligible for promotion. For the student of an Affiliate Teacher / Trainer, there are 3 things we provide, just to add that personal touch:</span>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>An orientation / planning session with a YM Coordinator</li>\r\n 	<li>A free 1 hour session with another trainer / guide / counsellor of the students choice.</li>\r\n 	<li>A certificate from us, and a vibrant letter from the student</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\nThese will be done when there is a minimum of 6 classes and only if the trainer chooses the Affiliate program, not the free listing one. Fees to be collected directly by the trainer and commission payable to either Imran / Bonus Professional / Coordinator.\r\n\r\nTo see this full document: <a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/o\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">http://yieldmore.org/o</a>','What is Peaceworks?','','publish','closed','open','','about','','','2018-01-18 16:07:37','2018-01-18 10:37:37','',0,'http://accredit.yieldmore.org/?page_id=2',0,'page','',0),(11,1,'2018-01-05 10:29:45','2018-01-05 04:59:45','We\'ve built a network of educated, charismatic adults who have a passion and flair for the English language, who are interested in teaching the nuances, not just for better communication at work, but as a tool enabling us to better understand the ideas that abound in the works we see around us (books, novels, movies). These ideas are important because they can change our perception of ourselves and the world around us, towards a more synergetic and holistic collective.\r\n\r\nLanguage is the most important because it is through it that we process over 50,000 thoughts a day, converse with our families, interact with our colleagues and customers and try and impress our boss. Its how we relax (music / browsing the internet / movies) and chat with our friends.\r\n\r\nHere at PeaceWorks, a YM initiative, we have trainers who can not only make you / your employees more easily understand and fluently speak to effect the day to day work, making more efficient communicators, but also instil a spirit of exploration and an ever growing quest for refining their language. <a href=\"/curate/\">Curate YM</a> exists for the purpose of giving you a place to explore new and interesting content.\r\n\r\nTo know more about the syllabus and what areas can be worked upon, please contact one of our trainers direct\r\n* Mustafa - 9840023721\r\n* Christine - 9840231722\r\n* Rani - 9952912041\r\n\r\nClasses can be done from  the comfort of your home / during a break at work either over the phone / skype / whatsapp. It can be spoken sessions or typed/emailed ones. Once a week, you could have in-person classes to further enhance the learning experience. We make all our students do the freewriting exercise regularly and suggest improvements.  To begin, you could simply send 10 lines on any topic of your choice to <a href=\"mailto:shasa@cselian.com\">shasa@cselian.com</a>.\r\n\r\nCourses are individually tailored based on individuals level and need and are charged at Rs 500/hour payable in 2-weekly or monthly advance direct to the trainer/tutor. A certificate will be provided by YieldMore.org upon completion, stating how many hours / weeks it was conducted for, what level was achieved etc.\r\n\r\nFor discussing corporate or bulk classes or registering as a trainer, please contact Imran at 9566166880.','Personalized English Tutoring','','publish','open','open','','english','','','2018-01-16 20:16:04','2018-01-16 14:46:04','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/peaceworks/?p=11',0,'post','',0),(3,1,'2015-11-23 02:06:33','2015-11-23 02:06:33','General chit-chat','General','','publish','closed','closed','','general','','','2015-11-23 02:06:33','2015-11-23 02:06:33','',0,'http://accredit.yieldmore.org/ask/forums/general/',0,'forum','',0),(4,1,'2015-11-23 02:06:33','2015-11-23 02:06:33','I am the first topic in your new forums.','Hello World!','','publish','closed','closed','','hello-world','','','2015-11-23 02:06:33','2015-11-23 02:06:33','',3,'http://accredit.yieldmore.org/ask/topic/hello-world/',0,'topic','',0),(5,1,'2015-11-23 02:06:33','2015-11-23 02:06:33','Oh, and this is what a reply looks like.','Re: Hello World!','','publish','closed','closed','','re-hello-world','','','2015-12-28 21:22:03','2015-12-28 15:52:03','',4,'http://accredit.yieldmore.org/ask/reply/re-hello-world/',1,'reply','',0),(7,1,'2017-12-25 15:59:43','2017-12-25 10:29:43','Electronics is the biggest market in the world. Our team of educating people in','Electronics','','inherit','closed','closed','','1-autosave-v1','','','2017-12-25 15:59:43','2017-12-25 10:29:43','',1,'http://accredit.yieldmore.org/2015/11/23/1-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(8,1,'2018-01-18 16:07:21','2018-01-18 10:37:21','This is the venture of YieldMore.org to impart career related skills to students and adults.\n<h2>Mentoring Network</h2>\nFor PWM (training) we have a free directory (<a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/peaceworks/people\">http://yieldmore.org/peaceworks/people</a>). If the trainer chooses to become an affiliate, we charge a fee from them of 20% and they will be eligible for promotion. For the student of an Affiliate Teacher / Trainer, there are 3 things we provide, just to add that personal touch:</span>\n<ul>\n 	<li>An orientation / planning session with a YM Coordinator</li>\n 	<li>A free 1 hour session with another trainer / guide / counsellor of the students choice.</li>\n 	<li>A certificate from us, and a vibrant letter from the student</li>\n</ul>\n\nThese will be done when there is a minimum of 6 classes and only if the trainer chooses the Affiliate program, not the free listing one. Fees to be collected directly by the trainer and commission payable to either Imran / Bonus Professional / Coordinator.\n\nTo see this full document, ','What is Peaceworks?','','inherit','closed','closed','','2-autosave-v1','','','2018-01-18 16:07:21','2018-01-18 10:37:21','',2,'http://accredit.yieldmore.org/2015/11/23/2-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(19,1,'2018-01-27 08:26:24','2018-01-27 02:56:24','Weâ€™ve built a team of User Experience and web design experts, UI / Backend developers, copywriters and marketing professionals (for both traditional and digital marketing).\n\nWe are YieldMore.org and one of our missions is to help NGOs with technology, contacts and volunteers. We charge for our time at a discounted fee (when we choose to charge, if at all) and bring you the best possible website built on modern platforms like wordpress that are mobile friendly and help you convey your message and engage your audience.\n\nWe can also help you with build a presence on social media networks, prepare logos, brochures, newsletters and other PR material, organize events.\n\nWe recently brought on board, an expert from a social work background who has much experience helping NGOs like yourself create awareness campaigns and candid videos presenting who-you-are to the rest of the internet world.\n\nWe can also help you plan Digital Marketing and Crowd-Funding campaigns and even collect money directly through payment gateway integrations on your website.\n\nWe offer a lot, but we do it with a sincere mind for helping you help the world become a better place. We would be glad to teach your own team/volunteers any of our diverse skills to help them fuel your goals.\n\nTo know more about what we can do for you and why were the best option, please contact Imran at 9566166880 / send an email to <a href=\"mailto:shasa@cselian.com\">shasa@cselian.com</a>. To see our full range of Products and Services, visit <a href=\"https://cselian.com/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://cselian.com/</a>.\n\nDo note, that we try and use our students to execute the work, thus giving them an opportunity to hone their newly acquired skill and helping keep the costs down.','SuperShare - Websites and IT help for NGOs','','inherit','closed','closed','','13-autosave-v1','','','2018-01-27 08:26:24','2018-01-27 02:56:24','',13,'http://yieldmore.org/peaceworks/uncategorised/13-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(12,1,'2018-01-05 10:59:42','2018-01-05 05:29:42','We\'ve built a network of educated, charismatic adults who have a passion and flair for the English language, who are interested in teaching the nuances, not just for better communication at work, but as a tool enabling us to better understand the ideas that abound in the works we see around us (books, novels, movies). These ideas are important because they can change our perception of ourselves and the world around us, towards a more synergetic and holistic collective.\n\nLanguage is the most important because it is through it that we process over 50,000 thoughts a day, converse with our families, interact with our colleagues and customers and try and impress our boss. Its how we relax (music / browsing the internet / movies) and chat with our friends.\n\nHere at PeaceWorks, a YM initiative, we have trainers who can not only make you / your employees more easily understand and fluently speak to effect the day to day work, making more efficient communicators, but also instil a spirit of exploration and an ever growing quest for refining their language.\n\nTo know more about the syllabus and what areas can be worked upon, please contact one of our trainers direct\n* Mustafa - 9840023721\n* Christine - 9840231722\n* Rani - 9952912041\n\nClasses can be done from  the comfort of your home / during a break at work either over the phone / skype / whatsapp. It can be spoken sessions or typed/emailed ones. Once a week, you could have in-person classes to further enhance the learning experience. We make all our students do the freewriting exercise regularly and suggest improvements.  To begin, you could simply send 10 lines on any topic of your choice to <a href=\"mailto:shasa@cselian.com\">shasa@cselian.com</a>.\n\nCourses are individually tailored based on individuals level and need and are charged at Rs 500/hour payable in 2-weekly or monthly advance direct to the trainer/tutor. A certificate will be provided by YieldMore.org upon completion, stating how many hours / weeks it was conducted for, what level was achieved etc.\n\nFor discussing corporate or bulk classes or registering as a trainer, please contact Imran at 9566166880.','Personalized English Tutoring','','inherit','closed','closed','','11-autosave-v1','','','2018-01-05 10:59:42','2018-01-05 05:29:42','',11,'http://yieldmore.org/peaceworks/uncategorised/11-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(13,1,'2018-01-05 23:55:58','2018-01-05 18:25:58','Weâ€™ve built a team of User Experience and web design experts, UI / Backend developers, copywriters and marketing professionals (for both traditional and digital marketing).\r\n\r\nWe are YieldMore.org and one of our missions is to help NGOs with technology, contacts and volunteers. We charge for our time at a discounted fee (when we choose to charge, if at all) and bring you the best possible website built on modern platforms like wordpress that are mobile friendly and help you convey your message and engage your audience.\r\n\r\nWe can also help you with build a presence on social media networks, prepare logos, brochures, newsletters and other PR material, organize events.\r\n\r\nWe recently brought on board, an expert from a social work background who has much experience helping NGOs like yourself create awareness campaigns and candid videos presenting who-you-are to the rest of the internet world.\r\n\r\nWe can also help you plan Digital Marketing and Crowd-Funding campaigns and even collect money directly through payment gateway integrations on your website.\r\n\r\nWe offer a lot, but we do it with a sincere mind for helping you help the world become a better place. We would be glad to teach your own team/volunteers any of our diverse skills to help them fuel your goals.\r\n\r\nTo know more about what we can do for you and why were the best option, please contact Imran at 9566166880 / send an email to <a href=\"mailto:shasa@cselian.com\">shasa@cselian.com</a>. To see our full range of Products and Services, visit <a href=\"https://cselian.com/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://cselian.com/</a>.\r\n\r\nDo note, that we try and use our students to execute the work, thus giving them an opportunity to hone their newly acquired skill and helping keep the costs down.','SuperShare - Websites and IT help for NGOs','','publish','open','open','','supershare','','','2018-01-27 08:26:32','2018-01-27 02:56:32','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/peaceworks/?p=13',0,'post','',0),(14,1,'2017-11-26 16:26:15','2017-11-26 10:56:15','I, Ghulam Mustafa Badsha, age 60, am a social entrepreneur based in Chennai with extensive contacts at the local, national and international levels. With a masters\' degree in Social Work, and a specialization in Human Resource Management, I have practical experience of all aspects of communication, i.e: advertising, public relations, branding, marketing and sales promotions.\r\n\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/peaceworks/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2018/01/mustafa.jpg\"><img class=\"wp-image-16 size-full aligncenter\" src=\"http://yieldmore.org/peaceworks/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2018/01/mustafa.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" /></a>\r\n\r\nOne of the key areas I specialize is social entrepreneurship whereby I have the ability to initiate, organize, refine and further any social issue which requires social action and reform.\r\n\r\nI am keen on guiding / mentoring young minds dedicated to being instruments of positive change, equipping them with the necessary knowledge and skills needed in this ever-changing socio-politico-economic environment.\r\n\r\nTo get in touch, call me on +91.9840023721','Mustafa','','publish','open','open','','mustafa','','','2018-01-24 08:44:50','2018-01-24 03:14:50','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/peaceworks/?p=14',0,'post','',0),(15,1,'2018-01-15 20:11:14','2018-01-15 14:41:14','<em><strong>Mentoring, Training, Guiding and Counselling</strong></em>\r\n\r\nThe aim of YieldMore.org is to facilitate the improvement of the quality of life for everyone. We believe in a process of steady and continuous improvement in the various aspects of life for individuals, groups and organizations.\r\n\r\nTo further this goal, we not only write and republish articles and curate content on our website and youtube channels, but also have built a directory of people capable of not just imparting skills / helping you, but also who can guide you to living a more empowered and fulfilling life. We believe in enabling people in all facets of FEPSI which includes\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Financial / Professional</li>\r\n 	<li>Emotional / Spiritual</li>\r\n 	<li>Physical</li>\r\n 	<li>Social</li>\r\n 	<li>Intellectual [includes Cognition / Perception / and Life Philosophy]</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThis holistic approach through direct one on one / group <strong>Mentoring, Training, Guiding and Counselling</strong>, along with the main arms of YieldMore.org which is <strong>Curation</strong> - digesting / selecting positive information and ideas from the world at large, and <strong>Content Development</strong> - writing articles and making gists / videos, we call the <strong>YieldMore Advantage</strong>.\r\n\r\nWe believe in a personal path to progress for everyone, whether they join us at the User / Player / Pillar level.\r\nTo see who we have on our Network, visit: <a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/peaceworks/mentors/\">http://yieldmore.org/peaceworks/people/</a> and to see the content that makes us stand apart, visit <a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/\">http://yieldmore.org/</a> and <a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/yt\">http://yieldmore.org/yt</a> (YouTube)\r\n\r\nTo know more about what we can do for you and why weâ€™re the best option, please contact Imran at 9566166880 / send an email to <a href=\"mailto:shasa@cselian.com\">shasa@cselian.com</a>.\r\n\r\nDo note that we have people with the passion and intuition who have recently begun their journey of helping others, so donâ€™t be surprised to find a guide younger than you. We select the best and let you choose\r\n\r\nThanking you for your consideration,\r\nImran Ali Namazi,\r\nChief Curator,\r\nYieldMore.org\r\nJan 15th 2018','Mentoring Network','','publish','open','open','','mentoring','','','2018-01-23 17:42:15','2018-01-23 12:12:15','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/peaceworks/?p=15',0,'post','',0),(16,1,'2018-01-18 16:24:40','2018-01-18 10:54:40','','mustafa','','inherit','open','closed','','mustafa','','','2018-01-18 16:24:40','2018-01-18 10:54:40','',14,'http://yieldmore.org/peaceworks/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2018/01/mustafa.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(18,1,'2013-08-15 17:55:36','2013-08-15 12:25:36','A technologist by profession, you can see <a href=\"https://cselian.com/imran/work.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">my profile</a> or <a href=\"https://cselian.com/imran/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">full resume</a> to know more.\r\n\r\nI founded YieldMore.org <a href=\"http://cselian.com/blog/yield/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">in 2013</a> with a few objectives. Publishing <a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/works/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">notable works</a>, promoting <a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/harmony\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">harmony</a>, growing together with other players and pillars as a facilitator, mentor, trainer.\r\n\r\nTo know more on what I can do, please see the tags below.','Imran Ali Namazi','','publish','open','open','','imran','','','2018-01-23 18:00:16','2018-01-23 12:30:16','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/peaceworks/?p=18',0,'post','',0),(20,1,'2018-01-30 20:18:51','2018-01-30 14:48:51','I am a 23 year old graduate of the Moulvi/Alim course in Tamil Nadu. Passionate towards spreading the word of Islam through means of Teaching, I like to teach children and young adults the fundamentals of our wonderful religion through Arabic and Islamic Studies.\r\n\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/peaceworks/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2018/01/abrar-hussain-1.jpg\"><img class=\"alignright wp-image-22 size-medium\" src=\"http://yieldmore.org/peaceworks/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2018/01/abrar-hussain-1-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /></a>\r\n\r\nSummary\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Proficient in Arabic Speaking &amp; Writing</li>\r\n 	<li>Good with Qirat and Tajweed Rules</li>\r\n 	<li>Creative ability in Arabic Calligraphy</li>\r\n 	<li>Engaging Speaker and Teacher</li>\r\n 	<li>Proficient with Computers and Technology</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nI also have an Intermediate level M3 from British Council UK/IN certification and can be contacted at +919003181499 <a href=\"mailto:abrary5@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">abrary5@gmail.com</a>.','Abrar Hussain','','publish','open','open','','abrar-hussain','','','2018-01-30 21:37:58','2018-01-30 16:07:58','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/peaceworks/?p=20',0,'post','',0),(22,1,'2018-01-30 21:35:54','2018-01-30 16:05:54','','abrar-hussain','','inherit','open','closed','','abrar-hussain-2','','','2018-01-30 21:35:54','2018-01-30 16:05:54','',20,'http://yieldmore.org/peaceworks/wp-content/uploads/site