INSERT INTO `wp_comments` VALUES (1,25,'admin','imran@cselian.com','','182.65.10.244','2015-07-03 06:13:37','2015-07-03 06:13:37','Imran\'s Article on I AM IONS:\r\nTitle: Programmer turning Inwards\r\n\r\nAll of my life I\'ve had a sense that creation was special. I am lucky to have 2 wonderful uncles who have been a treasure trove of inspiration and information.\r\n\r\nI\'m only 32, but have had some experience with the mysteries of life. These all were known by the Egyptians, Mayans and Atlanteans. We somehow lost touch with ourselves during the dark ages, but since 1600AD, have come into a new age of reasoning and of discovery.\r\n\r\nConsciousness is at the heart of everything, its what makes man the crown of creation (on Earth). Thats what drew me to IONS.\r\n\r\nWe are all gifted and it\'s up to us to explore/use it. My gift has been programming and believe me, it\'s an Art (like any other) when done properly. It develops the mind splendidly.\r\n\r\nBut technology is turning us into a bunch of mindless automatons. There is so much learning to be had (and shared). Thats why I created yieldmore.org to collectively share what we\'ve found to be real.\r\n\r\nThere is a beautiful line in the movie The day the earth stood still (http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0970416/quotes). It goes as follows: You say we\'re on the brink of destruction and you\'re right. But it\'s only on the brink that people find the will to change. Only at the precipice do we evolve. This is our moment.\r\n\r\nI think somewhere it\'s in resonance with the vision of IONS.\r\n\r\nOr, to put it in my own words (http://cselian.com/blog/reflections/ethos/dear-brother-of-both-kindreds/)\r\nAt the zenith of its flow, the exodus was turned. A hundred different movements began that systemmatically and lovingly changed the status quo. The animal instincts were humanized and the human instincts were hallowed and heightened.\r\n\r\nThis is my sincere prayer, to change the status quo.\r\n- Amen',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 6.2; WOW64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/43.0.2357.130 Safari/537.36','',0,1),(2,43,'Rita Sharma','ritasharma0102@yahoo.com','https://www.facebook.com/app_scoped_user_id/1226254754067527/','117.199.93.167','2015-07-24 14:23:50','2015-07-24 14:23:50','Man is basically selfish animal which has evolved in such a way ,it has power to justify,mold everything to its own advantage. In order to preserve and become supreme over all other beings on this earth,it breaks,makes different rules to benefit its own self. \r\nEating one way or the other hardly matters to its internal system which breaks down everything to its molecular level before using it to preserve the organism.  \r\nThere r no rules laid by \'God\' as such. All r made by men in order to dominate other members of its clan. So, the world has come out dark Middle Ages where now the technology is so advance that we r understanding the physiologists of organisms that we should stop following anyone or any book blindly. Books r written by men no matter what claim is made.',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (iPad; CPU OS 8_4 like Mac OS X) AppleWebKit/600.1.4 (KHTML, like Gecko) Version/8.0 Mobile/12H143 Safari/600.1.4','',0,3),(3,43,'Rita Sharma','ritasharma0102@yahoo.com','https://www.facebook.com/app_scoped_user_id/1226254754067527/','117.199.93.167','2015-07-24 14:30:20','2015-07-24 14:30:20','Vegetarianism or non vegetarianism is not the issue. It should depend upon one \'s own preference and availability. This subject is moot as far as religion is concerned. Because religious or spiritual persons are not bound to one or the other sect.\r\n\r\nThink about it, men are putting chains on other in order to dominate by making them guilty if they don\'t conform to the particular sect',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (iPad; CPU OS 8_4 like Mac OS X) AppleWebKit/600.1.4 (KHTML, like Gecko) Version/8.0 Mobile/12H143 Safari/600.1.4','',0,3),(4,43,'Rita Sharma','ritasharma0102@yahoo.com','https://www.facebook.com/app_scoped_user_id/1226254754067527/','117.199.93.167','2015-07-24 14:35:39','2015-07-24 14:35:39','Who told these religious pundits that if they sacrificed animals on the so called alters that they would be expunged of their karmas.  In fact it is all an illusion to escape the guilt of killing another being',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (iPad; CPU OS 8_4 like Mac OS X) AppleWebKit/600.1.4 (KHTML, like Gecko) Version/8.0 Mobile/12H143 Safari/600.1.4','',0,3),(8,93,'CÄ±vata','','http://dunno.dynu.com/civatacilar','54.171.83.145','2016-06-14 16:07:49','2016-06-14 16:07:49','[&#8230;] http://yieldmore.org/books/tattvabodha/ [&#8230;]',0,'spam','The Incutio XML-RPC PHP Library','pingback',0,0),(9,59,'Harmony &raquo; Organizations YM','','http://dir.yieldmore.org/harmony/','72.29.81.63','2016-06-20 18:20:41','2016-06-20 18:20:41','[&#8230;] To my planet and its people, I pledge my devotion. In their well being and prosperity alone, lies my happiness. I shall always strive to give them the best of me &#8211; kindness, happiness and help. &#8211; Paraphrasing the Indian National Pledge [&#8230;]',0,'1','The Incutio XML-RPC PHP Library -- WordPress/4.5.2','pingback',0,0),(6,47,'Harmony &raquo; Organizations YM','','http://dir.yieldmore.org/harmony/','72.29.81.63','2016-03-27 05:16:53','2016-03-27 05:16:53','[&#8230;] as our Lord accepts us. A minutes silence for contemplation and thoughts for world peace. &#8211; Unspoken by Shasa, Nov [&#8230;]',0,'1','The Incutio XML-RPC PHP Library -- WordPress/4.4.2','pingback',0,0),(7,41,'Harmony &raquo; Organizations YM','','http://dir.yieldmore.org/harmony/','72.29.81.63','2016-03-29 05:11:34','2016-03-29 05:11:34','[&#8230;] to put it in the words of Swami Vivekananda (from his closing speech at the world parliament of religions, Chicago, 1893: Assimilation and not [&#8230;]',0,'1','The Incutio XML-RPC PHP Library -- WordPress/4.4.2','pingback',0,0),(10,47,'Harmony &raquo; YieldMore.org','','http://yieldmore.org/movements/harmony/','72.29.81.63'