hought systems. For more, read theÂ about page\";s:6:\"filter\";b:1;s:6:\"visual\";b:1;}i:3;a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:5:\"Links\";s:4:\"text\";s:296:\"<ul>\r\n 	<li><a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/?o=1\">Sitemap</a></li>\r\n 	<li>Intro Popup</li>\r\n 	<li><a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/r\">Social Media and Redirects</a></li>\r\n 	<li><a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/yt\">YouTube</a></li>\r\n 	<li><a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/google\">Google Group</a></li>\r\n</ul>\";s:6:\"filter\";b:1;s:6:\"visual\";b:1;}i:5;a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:5:\"About\";s:4:\"text\";s:297:\"<a class=\"silent-external-link\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GpDJZfQqnWs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img id=\"footer-poster\" class=\"alignnone\" src=\"http://yieldmore.org/wp-content/plugins/wp-biblios/assets/images/yieldmore-afl-2019.jpg\" alt=\"YieldMore\" width=\"320\" height=\"220\" /></a>\";s:6:\"filter\";b:1;s:6:\"visual\";b:1;}i:6;a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:19:\"About YieldMore.org\";s:4:\"text\";s:1082:\"Driven by <a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/imran-doc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">one man</a> with a passion to link/enable people trying to change the world for the better, we are <a href=\"/?o=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">a repository of articles</a>Â /Â <a href=\"/miu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">a series of movements</a>Â  /Â <a href=\"/express/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">an expression of love</a>.\r\n\r\nSee ourÂ <a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/pulse/\">Pulse</a>Â / <a href=\"/newesletter/\">Newsletter</a>.\r\n\r\nFollow us on <a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/fb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Facebook</a>, <a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/twitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Twitter</a>, <a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/yt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YouTube</a> and <a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/ytc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YouTube Curated</a>.\r\n\r\nSee also:Â <a href=\"/start/\">Getting Started</a>, <a href=\"/get-involved/\">Get Involved</a>, <a href=\"/featured-content/\">Featured Content</a>, <a href=\"/pulse/\">Pulse</a> and <a href=\"/works/\">Published Works</a>.\";s:6:\"filter\";b:1;s:6:\"visual\";b:1;}i:7;a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:6:\"Notice\";s:4:\"text\";s:238:\"We repost content from the internet, usually citing the source, with the understanding that copyright holders will understand our full <a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/about/?node=spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">spirit and intent</a>.\";s:6:\"filter\";b:1;s:6:\"visual\";b:1;}i:9;a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:19:\"About YieldMore.org\";s:4:\"text\";s:764:\"YieldMore.org is a content portal which reposts inspiring and useful information from the internet and encourages people to <a href=\"/express/\">Express</a>Â themselves.\r\n\r\nA network of passionate people who believe in affirming life, sailing on that voyage of discovery and sharing, ours is\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>a social experiment</li>\r\n 	<li>learning and thought sharing platform</li>\r\n 	<li>repository of information</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nExplore our various <a href=\"/about/?node=ventures\">ventures</a> via the top menu, or view our <a href=\"/about/\">about</a> page or video:\r\n\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vvMsn5A5r_8&amp;list=PLNEB1ItETG4WdNT2bBTQs0GsvU39LKqQq\r\n\r\nsee this playlist:Â <a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/exposition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">exposition</a>\";s:6:\"filter\";b:1;s:6:\"visual\";b:1;}s:12:\"_multiwidget\";i:1;}','yes'),(84,'widget_rss','a:2:{i:1;a:0:{}s:12:\"_multiwidget\";i:1;}','yes'),(85,'uninstall_plugins','a:1:{s:43:\"register-plus-redux/register-plus-redux.php\";a:2:{i:0;s:19:\"Register_Plus_Redux\";i:1;s:13:\"rpr_uninstall\";}}','no'),(86,'timezone_string','','yes'),(87,'page_for_posts','9425','yes'),(88,'page_on_front','21','yes'),(89,'default_post_format','0','yes'),(90,'link_manager_enabled','0','yes'),(91,'initial_db_version','22441','yes'),(92,'wp_user_roles','a:10:{s:13:\"administrator\";a:2:{s:4:\"name\";s: