d you help translate WordPress into en_GB? I, Mark Scott Robson (@markscottrobson), one of the Locale Managers and GTEs for en_GB, will be hosting a drop-in session tomorrow (30 September 2020) between 11am and 12pm UTC/12pm and 1pm BST on the #polyglots-events channel on the Making WordPress Slack. Find out more about contributing to the [&#8230;]\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:17:\"Mark Scott Robson\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:1044:\"\n<p>Could you help translate WordPress into en_GB? </p>\n\n\n\n<p>I, Mark Scott Robson (<a href=\"https://wp-community-uk.slack.com/team/UFMT1NZHD\">@markscottrobson</a>), one of the Locale Managers and GTEs for en_GB, will be hosting a drop-in session tomorrow (30 September 2020) between 11am and 12pm UTC/12pm and 1pm BST on the #polyglots-events channel on the Making WordPress Slack. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Find out more about contributing to the English (UK) locale: <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1H20vf6QMOWISm0OLRziCFu4EvR77AJZ-IrqqBoC9vJU/edit\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1H20vf6QMOWISm0OLRziCFu4EvR77AJZ-IrqqBoC9vJU/edit</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>A week long celebration of translators of WordPress: <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://make.wordpress.org/polyglots/2020/09/28/welcome-to-our-week-long-celebration-of-international-translation-day/\">https://make.wordpress.org/polyglots/2020/09/28/welcome-to-our-week-long-celebration-of-international-translation-day/</a>.</p>\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:36:\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\";a:1:{s:10:\"commentRss\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:86:\"https://en-gb.wordpress.org/2020/09/29/international-translation-day-celebration/feed/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:38:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\";a:1:{s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:1:\"0\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:1;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:73:\"\n		\n		\n					\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n\n					\n										\n					\n					\n			\n		\n		\n			\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:5:{s:0:\"\";a:7:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:29:\"Introducing Twenty Twenty One\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:69:\"https://en-gb.wordpress.org/2020/09/23/introducing-twenty-twenty-one/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:77:\"https://en-gb.wordpress.org/2020/09/23/introducing-twenty-twenty-one/#respond\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Wed, 23 Sep 2020 16:42:19 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:6:\"Themes\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:35:\"https://en-gb.wordpress.org/?p=1261\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"