/a> to know more <a href=\"/about/\">About us</a>.\r\n\r\nWe follow the mantra - Learn, Heal, Share, Curate, Promote and Publish. See our <a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/p1\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">series of podcasts</a> to know <a href=\"/about/?node=what-we-are\">what we are</a>.\r\n\r\nTranscript of this video: <a href=\"/join\">yieldmore.org/join</a>\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MWAK3K7A6_Y','Getting Started','','publish','closed','closed','','start','','','2018-05-19 10:42:15','2018-05-19 10:42:15','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/?page_id=257',0,'page','',0),(9466,0,'2018-04-17 12:07:15','2018-04-17 12:07:15','<iframe width=\"525\" height=\"394\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=PLNEB1ItETG4WdNT2bBTQs0GsvU39LKqQq\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen></iframe>','','','publish','closed','closed','','73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-7850','','','2018-04-17 12:07:15','2018-04-17 12:07:15','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/pages/73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-7850/',0,'oembed_cache','',0),(9467,1,'2018-04-17 16:56:22','2018-04-17 16:56:22','','yield','','inherit','closed','closed','','yield','','','2018-04-17 16:56:22','2018-04-17 16:56:22','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/yield.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(273,1,'2018-01-26 07:26:46','2018-01-26 07:26:46','<iframe width=\"525\" height=\"295\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/PTIqjpkF5Ss?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen></iframe>','','','publish','closed','closed','','9441841a05a420a33056ec9bb7df996b-11','','','2018-01-26 07:26:46','2018-01-26 07:26:46','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/pages/9441841a05a420a33056ec9bb7df996b-11/',0,'oembed_cache','',0),(274,1,'2018-01-26 07:26:46','2018-01-26 07:26:46','<iframe width=\"525\" height=\"295\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/PTIqjpkF5Ss?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen></ifra