//www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=PLNEB1ItETG4WdNT2bBTQs0GsvU39LKqQq\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen></iframe>','','','publish','closed','closed','','73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-7823','','','2018-04-09 18:11:41','2018-04-09 18:11:41','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/pages/73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-7823/',0,'oembed_cache','',0),(9423,1,'2018-04-09 18:12:05','2018-04-09 18:12:05','<iframe width=\"525\" height=\"394\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=PLNEB1ItETG4WdNT2bBTQs0GsvU39LKqQq\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen></iframe>','','','publish','closed','closed','','73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-7824','','','2018-04-09 18:12:05','2018-04-09 18:12:05','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/pages/73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-7824/',0,'oembed_cache','',0),(9524,0,'2018-05-18 06:40:45','2018-05-18 06:40:45','<iframe width=\"525\" height=\"394\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=PLNEB1ItETG4WdNT2bBTQs0GsvU39LKqQq\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen></iframe>','','','publish','closed','closed','','73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-7897','','','2018-05-18 06:40:45','2018-05-18 06:40:45','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/pages/73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-7897/',0,'oembed_cache','',0),(9513,1,'2018-05-26 20:52:21','2018-05-26 20:52:21','Classifieds / C9S (CNS) is a page on YieldMore.org where people can post (by writing into us) stuff along with their contact details.\n\n<h3>Fundraisers</h3>\n<a href=\"/cnsWhoIsHussain is collecting money to fund heart operations for Iraqi children with congenital problems. This was already done 2 years ago in Bangalore. Discover the \"Joy of Giving\" this Ramadan.\n\n<h3>Events</h3>\n<a href=\"/cns/lrrs\">2018 June 2 - A Day for the Elderly women and Widows - Loyola Relief and Rehabilitation Services</a>\n\n<h3>Ways to help our community</h3>\nWe are looking for funds to\n* Pay people for supporting us with our podcasts.\n* Donate to the <a href=\"/b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">many not-for-profits</a> that we support, including spanda.org, buildindiagroup.org, ankuram-mandir.org, <a href=\"http://jobsfordyslexics.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">jobsfordyslexics</a>, healingforhaiti, seamovement.org etc\n* Pay for time spent developing the <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1eKEsLAJg7avVQWzVhhGnStj4gLeHbr9oumx21xlMMoc/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Guided Rejuvenation (Gaia Series)</a>.\n\n<h3>Job Seekers</h3>\n\nThe following friends are looking for Jobs: <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/john-rajkumar-8823b715/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">John</a> (a trainer / ops lead), <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/bharath-m-81321015/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Bharath</a> (a delivery / project manager), <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/adam-greenwood-5a40302/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Adam</a>.','Classsifieds','','inherit','closed','closed','','9476-autosave-v1','','','2018-05-26 20:52:21','2018-05-26 20:52:21','',9476,'http://yieldmore.org/pages/9476-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(9425,1,'2018-04-09 18:13:43','2018-04-09 18:13:43','','Recent Additions','','publish','closed','closed','','recent','','','2018-04-30 07:23:53','2018-04-30 07:23:53','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/?page_id=9425',0,'page','',0),(9426,1,'2018-04-09 18:13:11','2018-04-09 18:13:11','<iframe width=\"525\" height=\"394\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=PLNEB1ItETG4WdNT2bBTQs0GsvU39LKqQq\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen></iframe>','','','publish','closed','closed','','73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-7825','','','2018-04-09 18:13:11','2018-04-09 18:13:11','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/pages/73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-7825/',0,'oembed_cache','',0),(9427,1,'2018-04-09 18:15:17','2018-04-09 18:15:17','See our entire <a href=\"/?o=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">sitemap</a>, or check out <a href=\"/speak/imran\">Imran\'s</a> <a href=\"/swan\">Swan</a> and <a href=\"/love\">Love</a>. Read these <a href=\"/heal/topics/lessons/\">lessons</a>, or see <a href=\"/speak/veena/death/\">Veena\'s essays</a>, which links to our <a href=\"/topics/death/prayer-rebirth/\">prayer on rebirth</a>.\r\n\r\nBelieve in a <a href=\"/speak/imran/god-et-al/\">positive relation to God</a>, a <a href=\"http://media.yieldmore.org/islam/quran/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">soul-centric</a> <a href=\"http://media.yieldmore.org/sanskrit/imran/asatoma-sad-gamaya/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">revitalization</a> of <a href=\"/topics/religion/\">religion</a>, which <a href=\"/brahman\">underscores</a> the <a href=\"/gita\">need</a> for <a href=\"/practices/prayer/sivananda/\">prayer</a>.\r\n\r\nEnjoy reading <a href=\"/tolkien\">this creation myth</a>, or <a href=\"/poems/if/\">if (the Kipling poem)</a> or <a href=\"/poems/desiderata/\">desired things</a>. Learn the <a href=\"/vs\">Vishnu Sahasranamam</a> or read an <a href=\"/songs/the-logical-song/\">uplifting</a> <a href=\"/songs/\">song</a>Â or <a href=\"/songs/its-all-right-here/\">journey high among the stars</a>.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"/works/\">Read</a>Â / <a href=\"/works/essays-on-the-gita/?find=trigunatita\">search</a> a published work or just <a href=\"/poems/song-of-myself/\">idly</a> <a href=\"/topics/\">browse</a>Â our <a href=\"/movies-doc\">movie selection</a>. History <a href=\"/curate/songs/civil-war/\">bears the scars of our civil wars</a>, but we can <a href=\"/heal/articles/have-faith-the-game-is-not-over-yet/\">have faith</a>Â and <a href=\"/heal/topics/healing-and-forgiveness/\">learn</a> to <a href=\"/heal/habits/bless/\">bless</a>.','Featured Content','','publish','closed','closed','','featured-content','','','2018-05-01 14:38:33','2018-05-01 14:38:33','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/?page_id=9427',0,'page','',0),(9429,1,'2018-04-09 18:21:49','2018-04-09 18:21:49','<iframe width=\"525\" height=\"394\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=PLNEB1ItETG4WdNT2bBTQs0GsvU39LKqQq\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen></iframe>','','','publish','closed','closed','','73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-7826','','','2018-04-09 18:21:49','2018-04-09 18:21:49','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/pages/73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-7826/',0,'oembed_cache','',0),(9432,1,'2018-04-09 18:37:14','2018-04-09 18:37:14','* We meet every month on the last Sunday at <a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/devaragam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">home - Devaragam</a> on <a href=\"/meet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">hangouts</a> between 3 and 5pm Indian Standard Time (GMT + 5.30) and US/Europe call is at 8pm IST (10.30 EST). <a href=\"/meet-big\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Build India Group Meetings</a> are at 5.30pm. See our <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?list=PLNEB1ItETG4WdNT2bBTQs0GsvU39LKqQq&amp;v=EiJErn0LPYQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Launch recording</a> and <a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/l\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">presentation</a>.\r\n\r\nWrite to us with ideas and suggestions for content. Do pass the word around. Mentor those around you and share the sources of your inspiration. Live life to the full and spread good cheer!','Get Involved','','publish','closed','closed','','get-involved','','','2018-04-16 18:16:51','2018-04-16 18:16:51','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/?page_id=9432',0,'page','',0),(9548,0,'2018-05-27 19:14:56','2018-05-27 19:14:56','<iframe width=\"525\" height=\"394\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=PLNEB1ItETG4WdNT2bBTQs0GsvU39LKqQq\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen></iframe>','','','publish','closed','closed','','73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-7920','','','2018-05-27 19:14:56','2018-05-27 19:14:56','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/pages/73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-7920