e (GMT + 5.30) and US/Europe call is at 8pm IST (10.30 EST). <a href=\"/meet-big\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Build India Group Meetings</a> are at 5.30pm. See our <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?list=PLNEB1ItETG4WdNT2bBTQs0GsvU39LKqQq&amp;v=EiJErn0LPYQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Launch recording</a> and <a href=\"http://yieldmore.org/l\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">presentation</a>.\n\n[work config fol=pages/about][/work]','About','','inherit','closed','closed','','1-autosave-v1','','','2018-04-14 06:21:10','2018-04-14 06:21:10','',1,'http://yieldmore.org/pages/1-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(9460,0,'2018-04-14 15:08:44','2018-04-14 15:08:44','<iframe width=\"525\" height=\"394\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=PLNEB1ItETG4WdNT2bBTQs0GsvU39LKqQq\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen></iframe>','','','publish','closed','closed','','73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-7847','','','2018-04-14 15:08:44','2018-04-14 15:08:44','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/pages/73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-7847/',0,'oembed_cache','',0),(9463,1,'2018-05-13 02:31:59','2018-05-13 02:31:59','YieldMore.org is a close-knit network of people out to share and help. Not feeling so good? Let us try and <a href=\"/movies-doc\">replenish your vials</a>Â by joining our <a href=\"/wa-forum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WhatsApp group</a>.\n\nFind aÂ <a href=\"/v\">Venture</a>Â you care about to <a class=\"button\" href=\"/discuss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">get involved</a> or simply <a href=\"/?o=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">browse our</a>Â <a href=\"/curate/?o=0\">curated</a> <a href=\"/songs/\">content</a> to know more <a href=\"/about/\">About us</a>.\n\nWe follow the mantra - Learn, Heal, Share, Curate, Promote and Publish. See our series of podcasts.\n\nTranscript of this video: <a href=\"/join\">yieldmore.org/join</a>\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MWAK3K7A6_Y','Getting Started