30 23:00:28','2018-04-30 23:00:28','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/pages/73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-7865/',0,'oembed_cache','',0),(9488,0,'2018-05-01 06:18:48','2018-05-01 06:18:48','<iframe width=\"525\" height=\"394\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=PLNEB1ItETG4WdNT2bBTQs0GsvU39LKqQq\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen></iframe>','','','publish','closed','closed','','73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-7866','','','2018-05-01 06:18:48','2018-05-01 06:18:48','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/pages/73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-7866/',0,'oembed_cache','',0),(9489,0,'2018-05-01 13:06:42','2018-05-01 13:06:42','<iframe width=\"525\" height=\"394\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=PLNEB1ItETG4WdNT2bBTQs0GsvU39LKqQq\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen></iframe>','','','publish','closed','closed','','73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-7867','','','2018-05-01 13:06:42','2018-05-01 13:06:42','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/pages/73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-7867/',0,'oembed_cache','',0),(9490,1,'2018-05-01 14:37:57','2018-05-01 14:37:57','See our entire <a href=\"/?o=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">sitemap</a>, or check out <a href=\"/speak/imran\">Imran\'s</a> <a href=\"/swan\">Swan</a> and <a href=\"/love\">Love</a>. Read these <a href=\"/heal/topics/lessons/\">lessons</a>, or see <a href=\"/speak/veena/death/\">Veena\'s essays</a>, which links to our <a href=\"/topics/death/prayer-rebirth/\">prayer on rebirth</a>.\n\nBelieve in a <a href=\"/speak/imran/god-et-al/\">positive relation to God</a>, a <a href=\"http://media.yieldmore.org/islam/quran/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">soul-centric</a> <a href=\"http://media.yieldmore.org/sanskrit/imran/asatoma-sad-gamaya/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">revitalization</a> of <a href=\"/topics/religion/\">religion</a>, which <a href=\"/brahman\">underscores</a> the <a href=\"/gita\">need</a> for <a href=\"/practices/prayer/sivananda/\">prayer</a>.\n\nEnjoy reading <a href=\"/tolkien\">this creation myth</a>, or <a href=\"/poems/if/\">if (the Kipling poem)</a> or <a href=\"/poems/desiderata/\">desired things</a>. Learn the <a href=\"/vs\">Vishnu Sahasranamam</a> or read an <a href=\"/songs/the-logical-song/\">uplifting</a> <a href=\"/songs/\">song</a>Â or <a href=\"/songs/its-all-right-here/\">journey high among the stars</a>.\n\n<a href=\"/works/\">Read</a>Â / <a href=\"/works/essays-on-the-gita/?find=trigunatita\">search</a> a published work or just <a href=\"/poems/song-of-myself/\">idly</a> <a href=\"/topics/\">browse</a>Â our <a href=\"/movies-doc\">movie selection</a>. History <a href=\"/curate/songs/civil-war/\">bears the scars of our civil wars</a>, but we can <a href=\"/heal/articles/have-faith-the-game-is-not-over-yet/\">have faith</a>Â and learn to bless.','Featured Content','','inherit','closed','closed','','9427-autosave-v1','','','2018-05-01 14:37:57','2018-05-01 14:37:57','',9427,'http://yieldmore.org/pages/9427-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(9492,0,'2018-05-03 09:51:17','2018-05-03 09:51:17','<iframe width=\"525\" height=\"394\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=PLNEB1ItETG4WdNT2bBTQs0GsvU39LKqQq\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen></iframe>','','','publish','closed','closed','','73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-7869','','','2018-05-03 09:51:17','2018-05-03 09:51:17','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/pages/73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-7869/',0,'oembed_cache','',0),(9493,0,'2018-05-03 13:47:22','2018-05-03 13:47:22','<iframe width=\"525\" height=\"394\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=PLNEB1ItETG4WdNT2bBTQs0GsvU39LKqQq\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen></iframe>','','','publish','closed','closed','','73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-7870','','','2018-05-03 13:47:22','2018-05-03 13:47:22','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/pages/73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf2