.org/pages/73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-8536/',0,'oembed_cache','',0),(10229,0,'2019-01-19 01:23:45','2019-01-19 01:23:45','<iframe width=\"525\" height=\"394\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=PLNEB1ItETG4WdNT2bBTQs0GsvU39LKqQq\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe>','','','publish','closed','closed','','73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-8537','','','2019-01-19 01:23:45','2019-01-19 01:23:45','',0,'https://yieldmore.org/pages/73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-8537/',0,'oembed_cache','',0),(10230,0,'2019-01-19 01:29:46','2019-01-19 01:29:46','<iframe width=\"525\" height=\"394\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=PLNEB1ItETG4WdNT2bBTQs0GsvU39LKqQq\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe>','','','publish','closed','closed','','73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-8538','','','2019-01-19 01:29:46','2019-01-19 01:29:46','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/pages/73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-8538/',0,'oembed_cache','',0),(10231,1,'2019-01-19 03:55:17','2019-01-19 03:55:17','[info]\r\nlink: https://brainsync.com-\r\nlink: https://www.brainsync.com/the-secret-universal-mind-meditation.html\r\nlink: http://yieldmore.org/heal/practices/affirmations/\r\nlink: http://yieldmore.org/speak/imran/affirm/\r\nlink: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1t0yYYgVnAF4zaTK6Qb5dQm5FeR-gaDkLo-AkCh9mL6s|Self Development Presentation by Imran (Google Docs)\r\n[/info]\r\n\r\nThis program helps you change your thinking vocabulary. Remove the negative impressions and thoughts, think hard about your wellness in all facets namely Physical, Intellectual, Emotional, Spiritual, Professional, Financial, Environmental & Social. Lay out in clear words what motivates you, what your goals are, how your working to get them, what gives you peace of mind.\r\n\r\nThen record these words and play them back to yourself everyday until your convictions are marrow deep / you feel it in your gut. The affirmations template runs as follows, can always be expanded.\r\n\r\n* My core values are...\r\n* My values are...\r\n* I live for...\r\n* My qualitative goals include...\r\n* I am unique in that I...\r\n* My relation to a higher purpose or God is that...\r\n\r\nFill it and then get in touch with me, Imran, at +91-9841223313. My June 2017 Affirmation is at the link above.','[Self] Guided Rejuvenations / Affirmations','','publish','closed','open','','affirmations','','','2019-01-19 04:01:29','2019-01-19 04:01:29','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/?p=10231',0,'post','',0),(10232,0,'2019-01-22 19:15:16','2019-01-22 19:15:16','<iframe width=\"525\" height=\"394\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=PLNEB1ItETG4WdNT2bBTQs0GsvU39LKqQq\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe>','','','publish','closed','closed','','73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-8539','','','2019-01-22 19:15:16','2019-01-22 19:15:16','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/pages/73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-8539/',0,'oembed_cache','',0),(10233,0,'2019-01-23 13:05:45','2019-01-23 13:05:45','<iframe width=\"525\" height=\"394\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=PLNEB1ItETG4WdNT2bBTQs0GsvU39LKqQq\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe>','','','publish','closed','closed','','73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-8540','','','2019-01-23 13:05:45','2019-01-23 13:05:45','',0,'http://yieldmore.org/pages/73a1f3e330ad3b8282e038bf29ff2551-8540/',0,'oembed_cache','',0),(10234,0,'2019-01-23 17:05:28','2019-01-23 17:05:28','<iframe width=\"525\" height=\"394\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=PLNEB1ItETG4WdNT2bBTQs0GsvU39LKqQq\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-pictur